7468081931993088", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:59:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115926477887946868"], "id": "2115926477887946868", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Finally my dot just said \u201cthanks bro\u201d", "url": "https://x.com/DegenRisk/status/2115926477887946868"}, {"author_id": "21826040", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:50:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115924288100606387"], "id": "2115924288100606387", "in_reply_to_user_id": "58865213", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115855769665147254", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ajambrosino I\u2019d like to invite my dot directly into an existing session using an @ mention.", "url": "https://x.com/stefan_rem/status/2115924288100606387"}, {"author_id": "772288621248294912", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:45:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115923059060375893"], "id": "2115923059060375893", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1818311005698678784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 218, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115779686697697557", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@XFreeze It\u2019s been a really great tool. I switched off of ChatGPT Dots a week ago and can\u2019t see myself going back.", "url": "https://x.com/thedennisgrant/status/2115923059060375893"}, {"author_id": "2033946011421569025", "created_at": "2026-10-29T21:36:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2115920855024709880"], "id": "2115920855024709880", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2115801189631619472", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "gave my dot the ability to spin up